1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Kotori Itsuka.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Um, is it too late to get off? I want off.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Oh, it's way too late.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
More often than not, feelings have a way of complicating things.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
The red flame has forgotten the truth, while the white flame has discovered it.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
And when these two flames meet, everything will burn to ash.

7
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:04,000
All the air from the air from the cloudszurum.

8
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,000
The two winds have observed it perfectly.

9
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Oh

10
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Oh

11
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:06,000
These rides are so stupid

12
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Oh

13
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Yeah

14
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,000
I

15
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Wonder if Shida will survive this she's mad

16
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Actually

17
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000
This might end up being exactly what Coterie needed

18
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,000
I

19
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Think he just made the perfect call

20
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:30,000
We've blown this date out of proportion instead of letting it be

21
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,000
I hope you're right

22
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Are you scared?

23
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Give me your hand

24
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,000
What for? I'm not some frightened kid you know

25
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,000
Unless

26
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,000
You're the one who's actually freaking out

27
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,000
You scared?

28
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Yes that's it

29
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Please hold hands with me I'm so scared

30
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Stop acting like a weirdo

31
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Oh please Coterie hold my hand I'm so scared

32
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:59,000
Fine if you'll shut up

33
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,000
She don't know what a waste

34
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,000
If you hugged the commander

35
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:09,000
You could legitimately enjoy her soft supple body

36
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:13,000
You just lost the perfect opportunity to get a foot planted right into your face

37
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:17,000
Why? Why are you riding together?

38
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:21,000
You should let the commander drive the car by herself you idiot

39
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:25,000
That way you could be running in front of her as a personal target

40
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:29,000
Imagine the gradually shrinking distance as the commander smiles sadistically

41
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Trying to run you down and crush your dreams

42
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,000
Oh

43
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Mercy my sweet commander have mercy

44
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,000
Oh have mercy

45
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Shida was right

46
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,000
Throwing out his headset was a good call

47
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:45,000
Wow this jungle cruise is everything Shida said it would be

48
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Yes it is I'm having fun

49
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Feels good to relax

50
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:53,000
Don't you think it would be even more fun if Shida and Coterie were with us though?

51
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Why didn't they want to come too?

52
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,000
Wait, why don't we go get them?

53
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,000
You can't do that Choka

54
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:02,000
Why not? We should all be having a good time together

55
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,000
Yeah, but that's not it

56
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:08,000
We might have overheard something kind of major

57
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Coterie's really a spirit?

58
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,000
Shida's trying to save her

59
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:21,000
He's going to seal her power away like he did with both of us

60
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,000
He needs this time

61
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:25,000
So we shouldn't interrupt him

62
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,000
We've gotta let him do what he needs to

63
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:31,000
We heard that if he fails they don't know what will happen to Coterie

64
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,000
Chances are it's not good

65
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,000
We need to stay away Toka

66
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,000
Yeah, okay, I guess you're right

67
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,000
But I do wish there was something we could do to help them

68
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,000
I owe Coterie so much for what she's given me

69
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,000
It's hard to just sit here

70
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Besides, I like Coterie a lot

71
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Don't you think she has the same kind of smell as Shida?

72
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:53,000
That's probably because they use the same shampoo!

73
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:57,000
We have to let Shida handle this

74
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:59,000
It's the best thing for Coterie

75
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,000
We've got an emergency here

76
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
DW-029 has disappeared

77
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,000
No evidence of a transport vehicle

78
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:09,000
The white licorice battle suit has been stolen

79
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:11,000
Whoever has it took all the ammunition as well

80
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,000
It isn't ready for field use yet

81
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
The deployment inspection made that very clear

82
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:22,000
Do you think it would be possible to even defeat Ifrit using this?

83
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:24,000
Origami

84
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:30,000
Man, I underestimated this theme park

85
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:32,000
Talk about a good time

86
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,000
You are so immature

87
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:37,000
Maybe try to get out of those diapers before you graduate

88
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:40,000
This from the girl who was freaking out about a water slide?

89
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,000
You mean death trap!

90
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:46,000
Well, whatever, I'm over it

91
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:50,000
And besides, at least it wasn't totally boring, you know?

92
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:52,000
Yep, that's true

93
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,000
It's been a long time, right?

94
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Since we've been to a theme park like this

95
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:01,000
I can't remember though, do you know?

96
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,000
Yeah, five years

97
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,000
Really? That long?

98
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:07,000
Spirits killed my parents, they burned them

99
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:11,000
Five years ago, somehow I became a flame spirit

100
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:14,000
What is it?

101
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,000
What is it?

102
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,000
Oh, is it happening now?

103
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Kotari?

104
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,000
Yeah! What is it?

105
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:25,000
Uh, look Shido, I... I think...

106
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:28,000
Well, this is just as good of a time as any, but...

107
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:33,000
I just, um, I want to go somewhere with fewer people because I'm really embarrassed

108
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,000
Why?

109
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,000
Uh, it's not obvious

110
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,000
We'll be okay right here, I promise you

111
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:44,000
Now, listen, Kotari?

112
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,000
Yeah, what?

113
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,000
I have a question

114
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:52,000
You can't just ask me like that, it's super awkward

115
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,000
Uh, wait

116
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,000
No!

117
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,000
Never mind, ignore me

118
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:01,000
I'm alright, so please just hurry up and ask your question

119
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,000
Yeah, okay

120
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,000
So listen

121
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,000
About... five years

122
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,000
Kotari!

123
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,000
Kotari!

124
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,000
Shido! It's dangerous here!

125
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,000
You need to leave!

126
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,000
Horigami?

127
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,000
Horigami!

128
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Why?

129
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,000
Do you have any idea what you just did?

130
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,000
Yes, Kotari is dead

131
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,000
I killed her

132
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,000
Heh! You killed me?

133
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:47,000
You don't make it sound like it was that big of a deal

134
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,000
I'm disappointed

135
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:01,000
I thought you were smarter than that, but apparently I was giving you far too much credit

136
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,000
Who knew you would get a hold of a missile?

137
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,000
And who knew you were crazy enough to use it?

138
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:09,000
Especially when you consider how many innocent people are around us

139
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,000
No!

140
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,000
Elohim Kibol

141
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,000
Come on!

142
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,000
I found you!

143
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,000
Finally!

144
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,000
Ah!

145
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,000
Ah!

146
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,000
Ah!

147
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,000
Ah!

148
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,000
I found you

149
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,000
Finally!

150
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,000
Ah!

151
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,000
Ah!

152
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,000
Ah!

153
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,000
Kodari!

154
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,000
Aragami!

155
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,000
Stop!

156
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,000
Ah!

157
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:58,000
You have to stop this!

158
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,000
Please, stop!

159
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,000
It feels weird

160
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,000
I know!

161
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Come on!

162
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,000
Let's go!

163
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:09,380
I know. Come on, let's go.

164
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:13,780
Hey, what are you doing, Yoshinan?

165
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:15,500
You can't go, Toga.

166
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:18,800
Remember, your powers are sealed inside Shido right now,

167
00:09:18,860 --> 00:09:20,880
so you might not even be able to protect yourself.

168
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:25,340
Whoever that is has to be pretty strong to create such a big explosion.

169
00:09:26,140 --> 00:09:29,060
If you go, there's no guarantee you'll come back alive.

170
00:09:30,420 --> 00:09:34,660
I appreciate the warning, but I'm not making Shido face that alone.

171
00:09:35,340 --> 00:09:36,780
But Toga...

172
00:09:36,780 --> 00:09:45,420
Shido is trying to save my friend Kotori.

173
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:47,200
He won't give up on her.

174
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:49,100
Me neither. Let's go.

175
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,760
Hey, Yoshinan.

176
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:56,740
I am... well, can I go?

177
00:09:56,740 --> 00:10:00,840
If you feel that strongly about it, I won't stop you.

178
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:12,260
Why on earth would you choose to use such an ill-behaving weapon?

179
00:10:12,260 --> 00:10:18,260
Deploying territory. Locking coordinates.

180
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:34,420
Shockingly not too bad.

181
00:10:34,420 --> 00:10:37,940
I haven't seen that suit before. It must be a new one.

182
00:10:37,940 --> 00:10:45,080
No. I've used too much power.

183
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:46,580
Kotori!

184
00:10:46,580 --> 00:10:47,900
Leave, leave, ready!

185
00:10:48,900 --> 00:10:49,360
Fire!

186
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:53,320
Deploying territory.

187
00:10:55,380 --> 00:10:56,540
Blast Ark ready!

188
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:57,920
Annihilate her!

189
00:10:57,920 --> 00:11:04,560
Kokori!

190
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:10,560
Protect territory! Deploy!

191
00:11:10,560 --> 00:11:17,120
Oh, no. Where did all your power go?

192
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,820
You're going to beat me, right?

193
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,700
You're going to shoot me, right?

194
00:11:20,940 --> 00:11:22,780
You're going to kill me, right?

195
00:11:23,020 --> 00:11:24,540
Then stop stalling.

196
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,480
Go on. Take aim before it's too late.

197
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,200
Otherwise...

198
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:33,340
You'll be dead before you know what hit you.

199
00:11:33,420 --> 00:11:34,840
Kotori, stop it!

200
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,440
What? Finished already?

201
00:11:42,180 --> 00:11:43,600
That's no fun at all.

202
00:11:45,660 --> 00:11:46,480
Come on.

203
00:11:47,020 --> 00:11:47,960
Make it open.

204
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:49,920
Do something.

205
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,340
Because if you don't,

206
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:54,020
I have absolutely no use for you.

207
00:11:54,300 --> 00:11:55,700
I said knock it off!

208
00:11:55,700 --> 00:11:59,240
Damn you, Efreet.

209
00:11:59,660 --> 00:12:02,200
Sounds practically dreadful, don't you think?

210
00:12:02,660 --> 00:12:04,620
Where did you hear about my little nickname?

211
00:12:04,980 --> 00:12:07,180
This is how you did it, isn't it?

212
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:10,560
This is how you murdered my parents five years ago!

213
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:13,140
What do you mean?

214
00:12:13,620 --> 00:12:14,660
Five years ago,

215
00:12:15,140 --> 00:12:17,720
my parents were brutally killed by a flame spirit.

216
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:20,140
I watched as you murdered them.

217
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:21,760
I remember everything.

218
00:12:22,420 --> 00:12:23,900
How could I forget that, though?

219
00:12:23,900 --> 00:12:25,600
How could anyone?

220
00:12:26,380 --> 00:12:27,280
Now you'll pay.

221
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:28,800
This is where you die!

222
00:12:29,260 --> 00:12:31,360
And I'm the one who's going to kill you!

223
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,900
No, I don't...

224
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:34,920
You're lying.

225
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:39,360
This time I won't miss!

226
00:12:41,660 --> 00:12:42,580
Kotori, no!

227
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:43,800
Territory condensed.

228
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:45,820
White licorice.

229
00:12:46,260 --> 00:12:47,400
Critical driving force.

230
00:12:47,860 --> 00:12:49,120
Origami, please stop!

231
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:50,220
You can't do this!

232
00:12:50,540 --> 00:12:52,380
Shino, get out of my way!

233
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:53,840
Like hell I will!

234
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:55,480
I told you,

235
00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:56,680
since they died,

236
00:12:56,780 --> 00:12:59,640
my only purpose in life has been to avenge my parents.

237
00:13:00,260 --> 00:13:01,080
Killing Efreet,

238
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:02,500
killing Kotori,

239
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:05,280
is the only reason I have for living!

240
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,160
You can't.

241
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:09,320
You can't kill my sister!

242
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,440
If you pull that trigger,

243
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,360
there's no going back.

244
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:15,880
I do this all the time.

245
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:18,620
I don't want to see you end up like Mana!

246
00:13:19,100 --> 00:13:20,920
I don't care what you want.

247
00:13:21,380 --> 00:13:24,040
My goal is to kill Efreet with my own hands!

248
00:13:24,620 --> 00:13:25,100
Origami,

249
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:26,780
just answer one thing.

250
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:28,680
You're only after Efreet, right?

251
00:13:28,820 --> 00:13:30,020
You want the flame spirit.

252
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:32,340
You're not after my little sister at all.

253
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:35,020
You don't want to kill Kotori Itsuka, do you?

254
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:36,900
What are you talking about?

255
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,260
Just answer me!

256
00:13:39,020 --> 00:13:40,220
You're after the flame spirit,

257
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:42,320
and my little sister has nothing to do with it.

258
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:43,500
Isn't that right?

259
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,820
You're not making any sense, Shido.

260
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:46,920
Yes,

261
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,100
I am after Efreet,

262
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:48,980
the flame spirit.

263
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:51,480
But your little sister is a spirit.

264
00:13:52,700 --> 00:13:54,100
No matter what you say,

265
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,100
that is a fact.

266
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:56,120
So please,

267
00:13:56,460 --> 00:13:57,520
get out of my way!

268
00:13:57,660 --> 00:13:58,260
Just wait!

269
00:13:58,800 --> 00:13:59,280
Origami,

270
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,360
I need you to give me some time!

271
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:01,780
No!

272
00:14:02,140 --> 00:14:03,960
This is my best chance to take her down,

273
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:05,500
and I'm not throwing that away!

274
00:14:05,900 --> 00:14:06,760
Listen to me!

275
00:14:07,060 --> 00:14:08,420
I know it sounds like an excuse,

276
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,480
but I'm not about to just sit here

277
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:12,020
while you murder my little sister!

278
00:14:12,380 --> 00:14:13,520
And on top of that,

279
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:14,860
I can't do nothing

280
00:14:14,860 --> 00:14:16,620
while my friend is in so much pain.

281
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:18,420
Yes,

282
00:14:18,800 --> 00:14:19,540
even so.

283
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:23,840
Origami!

284
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:35,680
Toka?

285
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:36,520
Yoshido?

286
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:37,780
We're here.

287
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:38,820
