303
00:14:59,580 --> 00:14:59,880
Hurry!

304
00:14:59,980 --> 00:15:01,260
I can't last much longer!

305
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:02,100
Thank you!

306
00:15:04,620 --> 00:15:05,760
I don't have time

307
00:15:05,760 --> 00:15:06,760
to screw around with you!

308
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:07,060
I can screw around with you, too!

309
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,820
Come on, Origami!

310
00:15:10,820 --> 00:15:11,820
You have to stop this!

311
00:15:11,820 --> 00:15:12,280
You have to stop this!

312
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:14,240
There's no point in killing Kotori!

313
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,980
You don't know what you're talking about!

314
00:15:15,980 --> 00:15:16,480
Yes,

315
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:16,500
Yes,

316
00:15:16,500 --> 00:15:16,520
Yes,

317
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:16,980
I do!

318
00:15:17,140 --> 00:15:18,000
Don't you remember?

319
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,260
You shot Shido!

320
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:21,220
We both thought you had killed him!

321
00:15:21,220 --> 00:15:23,600
It was so painful!

322
00:15:24,140 --> 00:15:25,800
I'd never felt that sad before!

323
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:27,160
I felt broken,

324
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:28,920
and more alone than ever!

325
00:15:29,500 --> 00:15:30,600
Isn't that how you felt

326
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,800
when you lost your parents?

327
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:34,060
Do you really want to put Shido

328
00:15:34,060 --> 00:15:35,080
through that kind of pain?

329
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:36,240
Because that's not fair!

330
00:15:36,420 --> 00:15:37,420
You're being selfish!

331
00:15:37,420 --> 00:15:39,000
Why wouldn't you want to hurt

332
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,380
such wonderful people?

333
00:15:41,540 --> 00:15:42,540
