340
00:16:05,420 --> 00:16:07,700
How am I supposed to confirm

341
00:16:07,700 --> 00:16:08,920
Kotori's happiness meter

342
00:16:08,920 --> 00:16:10,480
without getting in touch with Reina?

343
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:13,100
I have to seal her power,

344
00:16:13,260 --> 00:16:14,520
and I have to do it now.

345
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,520
It breaks!

346
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:20,300
Focus on me!

347
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:22,120
Kotori,

348
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:23,620
the truth is,

349
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:24,200
well,

350
00:16:24,380 --> 00:16:25,100
you'll always be

351
00:16:25,100 --> 00:16:26,160
my favorite little sister.

352
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:27,680
I'm prouder of you

353
00:16:27,680 --> 00:16:28,880
than you will ever understand.

354
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:31,200
I adore everything about you.

355
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:32,560
And I...

356
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:33,540
I love you.

357
00:16:34,540 --> 00:16:35,100
Really?

358
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:36,500
What about you?

359
00:16:36,820 --> 00:16:38,300
How do you feel about me?

360
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:38,920
Um,

361
00:16:39,340 --> 00:16:41,380
is this kind of an awkward time to ask?

362
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,000
Kotori!

363
00:16:45,260 --> 00:16:46,420
I feel the same way!

364
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,400
I love you, too!

365
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,600
I've always loved you!

366
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:51,680
I love you more than anything!

367
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:52,860
I love you!

368
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:00,740
I love you!

369
00:17:00,940 --> 00:17:04,440
I love you!

370
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:09,240
I love you!

371
00:17:10,580 --> 00:17:10,780
I love you!

372
00:17:10,780 --> 00:17:11,620
I love you!

373
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:11,880
I love you!

374
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:13,200
I love you!

375
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:13,980
I love you!

376
00:17:13,980 --> 00:17:21,800
