389
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,140
I don't understand.

390
00:18:05,660 --> 00:18:06,660
What are you saying?

391
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:07,580
I remember.

392
00:18:08,100 --> 00:18:10,160
I know what really happened five years ago.

393
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:11,500
I know what we did.

394
00:18:12,260 --> 00:18:14,540
But Ifrit killed my parents!

395
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:17,340
You are right that Ifrit was the reason the fire started.

396
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:21,340
But understand, Kotari didn't kill anyone.

397
00:18:22,020 --> 00:18:23,220
No, that can't be!

398
00:18:23,560 --> 00:18:25,380
I know I saw a spirit that day!

399
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,420
Yes, there was one there.

400
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:31,160
It's the same spirit that made Kotari suffer through all of this.

401
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:34,220
Do you really expect me to believe you?

402
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:35,860
Yeah.

403
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:37,320
I want to.

404
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:38,500
But I...

405
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:40,060
I just can't!

406
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,960
If that's the case, then you don't have a choice.

407
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:44,080
Shoot me.

408
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:45,780
Kill Ifrit.

409
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:48,880
Come on.

410
00:18:49,380 --> 00:18:50,860
You've said it before, right?

411
00:18:51,260 --> 00:18:54,260
No one should ever have to feel the way I felt that day.

412
00:18:54,260 --> 00:19:02,840
Activation limit!

413
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:04,060
