424
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:43,520
Shin, I'm so sorry.

425
00:19:44,020 --> 00:19:46,360
I'm entirely responsible for what happened today.

426
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:49,400
You mean because you had Toka and Yoshino go on the date?

427
00:19:50,140 --> 00:19:51,280
That wasn't all that bad.

428
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:52,200
No.

429
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:55,440
I should never have sent you out on that date in the first place.

430
00:19:56,220 --> 00:20:00,300
Instead, I should have had you seal her powers as soon as you woke up yesterday.

431
00:20:01,220 --> 00:20:03,340
But Kotari was so excited about the date.

432
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:04,300
I don't know.

433
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:06,000
I just couldn't take that away from her.

434
00:20:06,180 --> 00:20:06,500
Oh.

435
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:09,500
But even so, that was impossible, right?

436
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:11,920
Her happiness meter, it wasn't even full.

437
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:14,740
