466
00:21:22,620 --> 00:21:23,980
Well, yeah, of course it was.

467
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:25,980
I do love you.

468
00:21:26,180 --> 00:21:26,860
I always will.

469
00:21:27,940 --> 00:21:29,440
Uh, I was wondering.

470
00:21:29,880 --> 00:21:31,060
Because, no reason.

471
00:21:31,320 --> 00:21:32,400
As a sister, of course.

472
00:21:32,780 --> 00:21:33,880
