479
00:22:07,060 --> 00:22:11,600
If you and Yoshino hadn't come, I don't know what would have happened to Kotari.

480
00:22:12,100 --> 00:22:13,620
Or origami, for that matter.

481
00:22:14,520 --> 00:22:14,780
Hmm.

482
00:22:16,240 --> 00:22:18,180
I just responded to your feelings.

483
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:20,240
I'm sure it was the same for Yoshino.

484
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:24,240
I hope you'll keep saving any other spirits that might appear.

485
00:22:24,940 --> 00:22:26,020
Like you saved me.

486
00:22:26,560 --> 00:22:27,340
And Yoshino.

487
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:29,260
And Kotari, too.

488
00:22:29,260 --> 00:22:31,240
Sure.

489
00:22:31,780 --> 00:22:32,380
I promise.

490
00:22:33,060 --> 00:22:35,100
But, I wish you wouldn't kiss them.

491
00:22:35,800 --> 00:22:39,860
I don't know why, but I don't like it when I see you kissing someone else.

492
00:22:40,180 --> 00:22:41,220
