493
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:42,800
It's such a weird feeling.

494
00:22:42,900 --> 00:22:43,940
Well, let's see.

495
00:22:44,260 --> 00:22:46,200
I don't know if I can explain it.

496
00:22:46,220 --> 00:22:46,840
