497
00:22:47,400 --> 00:22:49,380
I think you should just shut up and kiss me.

498
00:22:49,600 --> 00:22:50,240
Oh, do you?

499
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:51,320
I do.

500
00:22:51,320 --> 00:22:52,880
I really do.

501
00:22:52,880 --> 00:23:01,800
Ooh, way to go, Yoshino.

502
00:23:04,860 --> 00:23:05,940
Don't mind us.

503
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:07,760
Just keep on doing what you are about to do.

504
00:23:08,180 --> 00:23:10,060
