505
00:23:10,820 --> 00:23:11,600
Ignore them.

506
00:23:12,660 --> 00:23:13,760
I'm right here.

507
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:16,760
Kiss her!

508
00:23:16,960 --> 00:23:17,600
Kiss her!

